From 9952b1a4e70b9a5d6a8d5f079526d1e9286391ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 11:21:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add editorial day plans with Claude-first generation.

Persist days as narrative blocks and unique pins, validate concreteness, enrich per pin via Places, and expose GET/POST /trips/{id}/days APIs. Light proposals no longer write template itinerary slots.
